OL,3,GNEWSAArea may see 27,000 homes built
OL,4,Aafter plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 27,000 more homes could be
OL,7,Fbuilt across a district where residents
OL,8,Fhad raised fears there would be "a new
OL,9,Ftown - without a new town plan".
OL,11,FHuntingdonshire has already seen a
OL,12,Ffaster rate of housebuilding than the
OL,13,Fnational average and campaigners have
OL,14,Fcalled for Huntingdonshire District
OL,15,FCouncil to "pause" its local plan to
OL,16,Flook at the "cumulative impact" of
OL,17,Fdevelopment.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
