OL,3,GNEWSAArea may see 27,000 homes built
OL,4,Aafter plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday the council approved the
OL,7,Flatest version of its local plan, which
OL,8,Fincluded about 4,000 homes at Wyton
OL,9,FAirfield and 3,800 at The Lattenburys
OL,10,Fat Hemingford Abbots.
OL,12,FThe Liberal Democrat council leader
OL,13,FSarah Conboy said voting to support the
OL,14,Fplan was "not an easy decision" and
OL,15,Fthey would work with government.
